Subject: [PATCH 01/34] Plutonium: Exo embedding (Phase 1) and window broker
 (Phase 2)

Viability work, the <native-window> element (EXO-EMBED) and the window
broker with grants, shell-only API and push events (EXO-BROKER).
Snapshot also in plutonium/patches/exo-phase2.patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
